msgid "Slint 原生 ContextMenuArea 与 Menu，在右击或按菜单键时弹出操作列表。支持分隔线、禁用项、勾选项与子菜单。"
msgstr "Slint's native ContextMenuArea and Menu show a list of actions on right-click or the Menu key. Supports separators, disabled items, checkable items, and submenus."

msgid "Slint 原生 Dialog，作为独立的系统窗口弹出，并按平台习惯自动排列 StandardButton。窗口由 Rust/C++ 宿主创建和显示。"
msgstr "Slint's native Dialog opens as a separate system window and arranges StandardButtons according to platform conventions. The window is created and shown by the Rust/C++ host."

msgid "Slint 原生 ProgressIndicator，以横条显示任务进度。已知进度时显示百分比，未知时切换为持续滚动的加载动画。"
msgstr "Slint's native ProgressIndicator shows task progress as a horizontal bar. It shows a percentage when progress is known and switches to a continuous loading animation when it isn't."

msgid "Slint 原生 Spinner，以圆环显示进度。占用空间小，适合卡片、按钮旁或局部区域的加载状态。"
msgstr "Slint's native Spinner shows progress as a ring. It takes little space and suits loading states on cards, next to buttons, or in local areas."

msgid "Slint 原生 TabWidget：标签栏与内容区一体，每个 Tab 承载一页内容。切换标签时各页的控件状态会保留。"
msgstr "The native Slint TabWidget combines a tab bar and a content area, with one Tab per page. Control state on each page is kept when switching tabs."

msgid "Slint 原生 Tooltip，指针在元素上停留片刻后在附近显示说明，移开即隐藏。可以是纯文字，也可以是自定义布局。"
msgstr "Slint's native Tooltip shows a description near an element after the pointer rests on it briefly, and hides when the pointer leaves. It can be plain text or a custom layout."

msgid "Slint 原生 Tooltip，支持自定义内容。"
msgstr "Native Slint Tooltip with custom content."

